  "description": "eeCLOUD is a high-performance data engine for .NET 8 built around a logical Memory model instead of a traditional ORM schema. It provides automatic database/table bootstrap, high-throughput Raw JSON storage, object graph persistence for nested models, clustering, reference indexing, date-range queries, mixed Raw JSON/V4 reads, and optional eeCACHE acceleration across PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, FTP and local cache backends. It is designed for backend systems that need productivity, flexible data structures and strong runtime performance without heavy ORM configuration.",
  "iconFile": "favicon.png",
