  "projectUrl": "https://www.eecloud.io/",
  "published": "2026-04-28T09:40:39.48Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "eeCLOUD 4.0 introduces the new Object Graph persistence paradigm alongside the existing high-performance Raw JSON storage model.\n\nNew in this release:\n- Target framework updated to .NET 8.\n- Added WriteObjectData for persisting nested objects into dedicated child memories.\n- Added ReadObjectData and ReadObjectIndexData for automatic object graph reconstruction.\n- Added ReadAllObjectData with support for the same main query patterns as ReadAllData, including date ranges, id, reference, field/value filters and paging.\n- Added UpdateObjectData for updating object graphs while leaving removed child rows unreferenced instead of deleting them automatically.\n- Added mixed Raw JSON/V4 read mode for gradual migration of existing memories that contain inline JSON rows.\n- Added schema evolution support for newly introduced child objects.\n- Added PostgreSQL optimizations for object graph reads and writes.\n- Added object graph compatibility with clustered parent memories.\n- Added objID support across storage engines.",
